+`ord g(sigma_rho)=12(2 rho-7)<0`, and the detector polynomial has degree 2
+with partitions one double root or two simple roots; those case-specific
+systems would then have to be derived.  Prop.6.1 alone gives only
+`delta_2^* >= 1`, which is below `7/2`.
